.TH QUIPU-PATH-BACKTEST 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-path\-backtest \- Backtest a pruned trajectory over recorded history
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu path backtest\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-omit\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItrajectory\-IRI\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Backtest a pruned trajectory over recorded history
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-omit\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Trajectory step to omit in a counterfactual
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItrajectory\-IRI\fR>

